sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite(s): N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State(s): N/a

    loop Every Configured clock-aligned Meter Values interval, for evseId=0 and all configured EVSE, until three Meter Value messages have been sent
        CS->>CSMS: MeterValuesRequest (timestamp, sampledValue.context = Sample.Clock)
        Note right of CS: timestamp: the intervals between the timestamps of the Meter Value messages<br>equal the Configured clock-aligned Meter Values interval
        CSMS-->>CS: MeterValuesResponse
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (timestamp, trigger = Periodic, component.name = FiscalMetering)
        Note right of CS: timestamp: the intervals between the timestamps of the Meter Value messages<br>equal the Configured clock-aligned Meter Values interval
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end

    Note over CS,CSMS: The Test System ends the testcase after it has sent three Meter Value messages
    Note over CSMS: Tool validations: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
